<title>FRANCE: UK'S CU has 5.55 pct of SocGen vote rights.</title>
<headline>UK'S CU has 5.55 pct of SocGen vote rights.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance company Commercial Union Plc holds 5.55 percent of the voting rights in French bank Societe Generale, French financial markets CMF (Conseil des marches financiers) said on Monday.</p>
<p>CMF said in a statement that Commercial Union breached the five percent threshold on May 9 and now holds 5,990,164 of the voting rights.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
